{"uid":"4d9da8e9991dfe01","name":"test_the_ruff_pin_in_ci_matches_the_one_developers_install","fullName":"tests.test_ci_local_parity#test_the_ruff_pin_in_ci_matches_the_one_developers_install","historyId":"1ee269072404b940437eb08c8b9b14d2","time":{"start":1789893350635,"stop":1789893350637,"duration":2},"description":"A version skew here fails CI on files the author never touched.\n\n    ruff's formatter output shifts between releases, so a developer whose venv\n    resolved a newer ruff formats a file the way *their* version wants, and CI's\n    pinned version rejects it. The diff then points at unrelated files, which is\n    the least useful possible signal -- and it happened: a local ruff 0.16.1\n    disagreed with CI's 0.15.20 on three files nobody had edited.\n\n    Both pins are asserted equal so bumping one alone is a test failure rather\n    than a confusing CI failure later.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>A version skew here fails CI on files the author never touched.</p>\n<pre><code>ruff's formatter output shifts between releases, so a developer whose venv\nresolved a newer ruff formats a file the way *their* version wants, and CI's\npinned version rejects it. The diff then points at unrelated files, which is\nthe least useful possible signal -- and it happened: a local ruff 0.16.1\ndisagreed with CI's 0.15.20 on three files nobody had edited.\n\nBoth pins are asserted equal so bumping one alone is a test failure rather\nthan a confusing CI failure later.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1789893192546,"stop":1789893192547,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_clear_prompt_info_cache","time":{"start":1789893350631,"stop":178989335063